WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
A promise slips. A receipt is filed away. A delivery goes missing. A promised refund never arrives. Willow Stationery is a synthetic purchase.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Read the receipt. Upload a text receipt and review the suggested fields. In a verified Workers AI run, a €12.45 item was predicted as 12 minor units.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Correct the record. The owner corrects the amount to 1245 and confirms the purchase. The original stays attached to the vault record.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Keep the deadline. A return window can end on a stated date. A warranty can run for calendar months. Aftercare keeps the policy time zone and labels elapsed-day estimates.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Read the policy. A private Sprite used the official Tavily gateway to search and extract REI policy pages. Applicability still needs review. The release lookup retained zero references.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Compare carefully. A lower price needs the same SKU, condition and seller, plus applicable adjustment terms. Comparable-price rules passed locally. A live qualifying offer remains unverified.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Identify the unit. CPSC notice 26-372 identifies Wybot Osprey 700 Max serial batches. A product name alone stays a candidate. A matching unit needs serial evidence.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:12.000
A delivery is overdue. The local worker detects the missed synthetic delivery. The protection assessment links the issue back to the purchase and its evidence.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Prepare the claim. Review the proposed letter and exact recipient. Select which original receipt to include. Redacting letter text leaves receipt bytes unchanged.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Approve one version. The owner approves the reviewed draft, including its recipient, body, redactions and selected attachment identity.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Download once. A real JSON claim package downloads. The acceptance regression replayed the same authorization and received HTTP 409. The claim is exported, unsent.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Follow the refund. The overdue $12.45 refund moved from processing to disputed. Prior sources remain visible. Receipt of funds is unconfirmed.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:57.000
Pick up the thread. The local worker posts a due follow-up. The inbox shows the reminder and Activity retains the recovery history. Only the synthetic due time was advanced.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:06.000
Recover after wake. On the private Sprite, the restarted journal retrieved the purchase and identical receipt bytes. Independent scheduled wake of a cold private Sprite remains unverified.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:15.000
What passed. The owner completed all 24 local checks. All 31 application tests and 20 browser tests passed. The production build passed.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Aftercare A private record from receipt to recovery. Verified integrations include Fly.io Sprites, official Tavily search and extraction, and Workers AI text-receipt inference.
